{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1284,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edd80c32817bc4828149cdb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个布贴是妹妹们做给我的喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3cd34d2ad46eff6b0d940b6d973cef4e68235370dd8f0736f6034e178f8ba53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4bcf36a85cbeb216a109d39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好，顺利换好衣服了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c504d885a5962f0bfb8809cfd4940aa87eabbc945b2720132e64f81dc541456",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c77fcef45187ed92e241ba06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈，别闹了，这样很痒～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09742becc52ffd1cae8f92df7ec042e372b252f20661d3a92b6f6c2cebe78c0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c55f740bdcffe955f30b8ab8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7705fe5a323494d9f8d4b0c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キミが挑戦者？よろよろ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77b4ce97c332a0dddd14ae316db0e454d8952b007121e503afc0645426a89d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20082d6be2fbe3228d33476c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "へー、やるね！\r\nでも…今度は追いつける？",
      "source_fingerprint": "04d99a2860e5a6748ec8d65ed84b683a8e3e7a9d2133c2103212e5a2ef609c9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b2ac0fd5a7c6feeac4b3948",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安早安～♪\r\n你有好好吃早餐吗？\r\n储满能量努力一整天吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "020d859abd7aff113c1c46c5689a6d96cd207aab4410a69c5e109b5aeb71bf7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed14e8a314ea4642704716ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头发没有乱翘吧？\r\n衬衫有烫好吗？\r\n……好！那就出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2afc2f290c06f863d7c21617d4a6b7eb43d8f8bdcdc9831e3e94ed98af27638a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80cee9e21dafc7206c25c1cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大吃一顿后就变得很有精神！\r\n所以我要去做冲刺训练，\r\n帮助消化了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "110d333888f5376fab29fb16bd57e6af018f599f06523073a664ba2f16a9779d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b10fa53c2f75717aef71bfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我偶尔会去一间餐厅帮忙，\r\n下次去那里吃午餐吧！\r\n我可以帮你把饭升级成大碗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f49bd1a58ed0eb324f2e4f6a6088c77ad61152a68d6588f09a377bbd03bdd2dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf4cd66565e02e55415b7e28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，害我捏了一把冷汗～！\r\n今天的打工外送去到偏远深山里……\r\n我一直担心会赶不上门禁时间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42becf0b91d5e5ffefbd0f7d47d781f63b9892ec72d514c6ef73ceef23f0a376",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b58bad897da25d491d440c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对妹妹们说如果熬夜，鬼就会\r\n跑出来……但她们一点都不怕！\r\n还反过来吓我～",
      "source_fingerprint": "708473ac84018a47ed41e3b235c10d40010d9e47a143a892b5d9c820416633c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5410aaaea4281777d0f41499",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了春天，会有许多新生\r\n开始想家吧……对了，\r\n去邀她们一起跑步吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e639c4c6e9b3ec41065cf9923a431efcd305b3166d8b35d9c98288ed22b6f077",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce0612b58d764f320cdae643",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海之家、旅馆、打扫游泳池……\r\n夏天有许多难得的打工机会！\r\n嗯～今年该做什么好呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "13970ee051193b9b184bfc5cdba11888ee9cd50c8e27f34a7d500da8dc505c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7493a1f546ae3b81c7cd978a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每次看见被扫成一堆的落叶，\r\n就会想起曾和妹妹们一起烤番薯……\r\n好！下次回去时再烤一次吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df5ec224054d61b425245baaf0ae656c3408a6565fa2ee8b5815b1ef92ec60e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6af9f347b705f97cb77ea9e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天有圣诞礼物和压岁钱……\r\n真是令人开心！虽然开心……\r\n但是不是该多接一些打工呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9adcc56878af95d1afcb01bf83b1221422811ec6092c25040bc5fab840c1f4f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f147ddeb1164cb99f78b600",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啰哈啰～！\r\n要不要喝杯咖啡提神啊？\r\n姐姐我去拿来给你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89546ed76a85ef2e427411e41ec5ff75256f8cda38f9b838db64d5dfcef256c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:807336e870bbb03c050e38fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～一大早打完工后晒晒太阳\r\n真是格外舒畅！啊，你现在\r\n正要去上工吧？加油啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c41138bcfe128563f4bdddcac04836bd78a87ceb5e8d36b1ca493caf152964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39ba118a9098ea87c8df383e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你吃午餐了吗？\r\n我手上有些打工处的折价券，\r\n还没吃的话一起去吃吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac867f5edf445a6c7c57305d3290103282aa36614bc92a60f72b0a926e71e8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58001ba512f6485676a666cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有人找我点一份午间套餐……\r\n我也知道是自己不该穿成这样\r\n走进咖啡厅啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f22d87f6c805d6c6eb5ff3d8509c11d475813b7c743f113ec0784e16d0e5a9f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5673c8440a0608c7323efba1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "工作到这么晚真是辛苦了。\r\n我在你桌上放了一份三明治，\r\n饿了就当夜宵吃吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe7ff60061f1600ba5e1c5d1e48f793c17299962e7059d9f4fe0bf490a1c0ea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f94ec07ded9a37f3babeca1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也很推荐下班后到咖啡厅放松喔。\r\n顺便一提，即使时间很晚，\r\n我也愿意随时为你服务喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ecb20f58a63d5efbb3b5f23b9b9d17344a55e66f8c57c208ed0d091d26c3ae2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd9ab6db3f058cdcdecb5c38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到新生就会忍不住\r\n想多多照顾她们呢。\r\n送些点心应该没关系吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7b3a1363c5e86ceefa2ea4bb5cde3eef69074e1e989ecb76e68d5c92e35bc12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b925635d720fb61224acfc23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天阳光很强，要多注意喔！\r\n对了，要不要戴上遮阳帽？\r\n我现在用不上，可以借你喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f022a09b12b53d951877e9b5aa58e25aebe183ee7e6842ee0f8c5dd420aaf8b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf3a20bf260740f940e71f88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋季限定料理的季节到了！有成堆的\r\n南瓜和栗子要处理，感觉会很忙……\r\n不对，我忘了我正在休假！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d20b7dbc1977bfe7608cdc6f6239d5943731ebef55000b527140d192eb8ab84b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc168ed9851e6316ffd23c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气这么冷就想来点暖和的食物呢～\r\n顺便告诉你端热食的诀窍，\r\n手要放在容器底部的突出处♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcce5f068319856e4eda9d8722201b42ee6523ff0616cab51158fd5b014d9b08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbfddbe2d0431d25bb337d25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89d464e8115ea91cc1f8cdfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8af69e9f91b20e89ca46271",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～果然和小赖恩一起训练最棒了！\r\n有种互相竞争的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "308cfb902c3969a827ddd77b0453ee890b02740250218b1a024d76fc4022e047",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cab40e3b0b476bb99e72e6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～虽然想和妹妹们一起玩……\r\n但她们也会担心打扰到我训练，\r\n真让人烦恼～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35a9188fa4f05f7f2d0fff7717eb9235c8a8648472a5ad28209828b4bbe67b6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d660d43948a7af20f0c221d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和小太阳神一起玩时，\r\n最重要的就是气势！\r\n总之先嗨起来！……应该是这样吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "35943aa4ee83c360dd447208a3783b3789f30dcfd02b2131f5d8648faf892a15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d4d252516430375d3e34ed2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟你说，明天先不要买午餐！\r\n我有想尝试的食谱，\r\n希望你能陪我一起试味道♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b618763f4ee2a92e8588910f81fe36c1c82288016b314d73ad2eba91f79e57c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fcf32cf99a9eb8669c24242",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的雀斑很可爱吧？\r\n呵呵，妈妈也说\r\n这是有精神的证明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba6c46ab58e4e5d9e53088c710e63df3b5782b336a1a258a117bf129e561d19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c7797696b7d96f4a1593519",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯……总觉得不太自在……\r\n这件衣服果然还是有点太可爱了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e396c31a7552840dfda16ae92fd09210e94de9b93c0dcefb50ec67d1c0905375",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55f07c4284c46e4f531c1abb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能多参加几场演唱会，\r\n我要参加很多比赛拿下胜利！\r\n好～我燃起斗志了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "539398a2e95705f1aadfe673574cf7af9c623c9d52bcfdff9c7a3c9a09fff509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d9ef3b9447ed956526c42a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家人的意志、你的意志，\r\n还有我自己的意志……这件衣服\r\n一定承载着所有获胜需要的意志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fbdf67ec85eddeea7da4f41a3f8be6e05953b43f8d1e6b857c6c6ffb8589b67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa98ca719987d8f6add77bfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿上决胜服，\r\n心态就会跟着转换，\r\n觉得「唔喔喔喔～要跑啰～」呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d39bd3099a59a332de77ccee41b3e530e1b736380a53a8237f6c4aba57751b2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5df5dd4ac1f6215bafc844f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，先去跑一趟吧！\r\n早上跑步会让人觉得一天要开始了，\r\n非常畅快呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ea932ccbbbce8c5c7c0a33a27d9d029dde34ea62a66cf96c65fccc8dc0e92e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dab3e8a3ba25c97bfd62bf83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中午最好是能好好吃一顿饭！\r\n不过……如果当天很忙，\r\n就会不小心只吃能量棒……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc072556642b18d666da1a2f2e855065f4e0a7fc34e6d3ef250dc9b020aa2534",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92906f8893f6b4996ccf2400",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上必须好好休息！\r\n因为明天也要请你从早上\r\n就开始陪我一起练跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ca6c416d5f25d50f644d933d628a30ff4f34f7049cc33954d53ac951346adc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2e66bf1e6e06356d902e29c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要大跑特跑！在特雷森学园\r\n刮起春天的第一阵强风！\r\n开玩笑的～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbb01fdc4f4e98c872432f4b8072a239d9454d80ef610951c3b191e63e4e5eaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3d703f193f30c102c227905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在摊贩打工很有成就感！\r\n大概是因为离客人很近，\r\n能带给他们许多活力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea928dc8f2c187c8ff152ee637b2fa218b31895a73dd14ad3a5e215c7ae83827",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c8962bbc8135351966099e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢迎面冲向\r\n开始有点变冷的秋风，\r\n虽然会冷，但感觉很舒服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa3d207c64e3ff0325c22d72c1360c91e4a94a24d9fe7b1ca478e474aef23c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c085e8ef6181bb372c230e4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "靠跑步温暖身体吧！\r\n最近空气很干燥，\r\n要记得洗手漱口喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a6ca71a2775ef3a0e3ed58c0d5ce208eac50e6f7b0c74e3e2f4f94d658c4c85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed2b3247ebe68ae2e7545cc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不觉得赖恩也很适合这套衣服吗？\r\n然后她再用那精神满满的声音\r\n爽朗地打招呼……一定很可爱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "17d09cae7a9f0df0b145ffe8b2dbda919602f26974ff34ca00aef5826bf46083",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a68aef234150c3e491390c3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我叫小微的时候不小心叫成\r\n我妹妹的名字了……耶嘿嘿，反正\r\n她就像妹妹一样可爱，没关系啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a2498b0be702f9c7b8a4ab237064f5955e4b02779220d338b4a1aaa11a0d6dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11d78b9ea292ea74b440fa91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请小美点餐时，不管点什么\r\n她都会用「美丽」来正面响应！\r\n听了连我都觉得很舒畅呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1da08f80b415e3bb3d4e6460822be86ca5bdd7abdbc02cd1f477c7aa3ccd609",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f82ce881e9ad4cb715b64ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～啊……嗯？这个啊，我在练习\r\n发声！毕竟打工时须要常常说话嘛。\r\n好～今天也要加油……欢迎光临～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad948edf948c8a40d0081dd8305d292e1e9961e6bf287c6b296189712b7cfac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24fd5e3af1670733d9e4e17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说我打工的拉面店也想设计一套\r\n不输给这服装的制服喔。听他们在\r\n讨论头套设计……有种不好的预感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "441cbffebee9aedaeab50670b24c0bde0452f7c836c93d4c31be43f468c9cd9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88321c2ddf5a6bac04893d9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的～你一脸困意喔～\r\n试着大声打招呼提振精神吧。\r\n来～跟我一起喊……欢迎光临～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63a1628a0b8c8ed819d5506002e39765b2f2d9e41829fe81c9d0aa1992eb3cac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:257f24eb44b4c33f5ae46108",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次我想在外面吃午餐时，\r\n就会忍不住想多体贴店员……\r\n毕竟午餐时段很辛苦呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd16ce8dccdcb28f2597b4cf0c57999724633a11e74f09f1a3134ff32252315f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18538c951b6ca2ac0c94ec11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天已经黑啰。哦，看你这么惊讶～\r\n我懂我懂，忙起来的时候\r\n时间真的过得很快呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5372a97128724a48de3656dbda8bcc0e3a951b6930b8f59ac3ace2f116194872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2da28bd1a53c35a3ee9ed59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这时期都会有很多新客人喔～\r\n看到那些青涩的表情，\r\n让我也不禁想为大家加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "983e7e9e82da94c0a8be8cacab6dfb3d3de83ec5beef6479cde9a06a8fa271b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1cbfd3095f87e4020534b01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你觉得在海之家开快闪咖啡厅如何？\r\n夏天嘛，来卖海盐香草圣代\r\n好像不错！还可以补充矿物质！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80cf29eb05c212fe3c0cf51232a0c4da4b43f025631ea42f3c4801c8970901b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a38c454f1ef66107bd4bf5bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "石烤番薯？我推荐直火烧烤会更香。\r\n我可是曾经卖过烤番薯，\r\n你就听听当参考吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dca1b5fc37118c6570d5b1b21b4e92616fa6305064ec4844b3bfd412f3353a84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f613043be70fe237923060a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我泡杯热可可给你吧？\r\n是妈妈教我怎么泡的！\r\n喝了身体会立刻暖起来，很推荐喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1ae8588cd2efcd01f930194c699847d62aa49816d368fc7c78d920c2294eb22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a520b7e03896b376b5842747",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我曾做过不少打工，\r\n这是我穿过最可爱的一套制服了！\r\n又有很多口袋，实用性很高呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "393381fe5f215aae44aa146fc035971ee5e9d515403019e7d01e06b498fe66b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a310b780c4c6fe01265f39b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头上只要没戴遮阳帽，\r\n总觉得有点心神不宁……\r\n别、别一直盯着我喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "054a7f320529ae0de5a950a36cb78f90f64ea97b945156aa5d05dbfe3518a195",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e76c44fcb49bedee53e38dc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚的状况，没问题！\r\n遮阳帽的位置，没问题！\r\n活力和干劲更是完全没问题喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4367260f4f02e92934f6b34f2e0f8a1e7b731cebb9d6ae24d46bf1b4875e9054",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45e9609a172c82f160409a3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やっちゃうの！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8d332605cd8cf624923f74d50ff5829764fee7481ffe432ad49cf6d1735c214",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19edd7561db849ac432ac1ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热身运动都做好了！\r\n快点让我尽情奔跑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac3c8ae375c4b85def6e9ace18a405e4a1f1108e547d7a3a37dd7b011eadf700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6290a61189346634907ab2c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天排的是晚班……\r\n太好了！\r\n可以做很多训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd3b678687fe1220c51ecf1d8082dce5ba97b7d4df11b7b9c7c20663dda99e0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f0b4be9c7ed18c7e6fc754a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是体干训练、重量训练，\r\n还是超市的限时特卖，\r\n都尽管来吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d830ba449001060cdaca9c13d0d91472f45ce8977db4400f8085dbb0fabf786",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13f4dc8f6ec68732b83962f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员安排的练习项目\r\n有很多机会跑步，非常开心！\r\n今后也要让我尽情奔跑喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec53dee6d405174a248777ad3bd4db06a9d91da195c24c6875508cfe40360702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc153e75b16750c8827da24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是和你一起训练，\r\n我一定能跑得更快！\r\n好～要加油啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc2d1a3287e24d544b4dff2b63ee69f3a6cbb5b5d522c1e3de3f2b8ff6d67abb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:362a30a84461cbde11b87b31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为你给了我许多信任，\r\n所以我也相信训练员！\r\n想让你看到我最好的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ef0ecf92b87145ae62ed0e9fa5c1631151517d9b903aaf100fc3a2927671f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbc91df766727f8bd7a77d7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～阳光真耀眼～！\r\n幸好我有遮阳帽～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2152585e6680fe09fa18f3938972562485b5545b882c4d14e438d691337237b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5076b872ad1821a343a7f2a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天想先从哪一项开始？\r\n看是要老样子还是想点特别品项\r\n都可以，随便你点～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "42c11f0df3a395da227386ca8452fbd741671614cc5666db7a27ffc3c370b073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fae89d9a283051fc308319b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你可以慢慢思考要点什么喔♪\r\n我等你决定～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c02fe2d2bdd4e8e0fa59183aeaf01be5b08c9d7f58b39b0f08e22b2a73821679",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6507354b5b925c0f33829c9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论打工还是训练都是\r\n活力最重要！今天也要\r\n卯足全力加油喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7005ab71b1df4069acdf6baa7d47616082a61b10610fcd9be3143c452636616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42b343dd9724a2d417db5b68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想点很复杂的也没问题喔。\r\n我会好～好地写下每一个要求，\r\n完美达成指令的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3775e16269ea3a497d7ea99ae37b792728e33a717461563ec005572bd85e17c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e25953fc667e3ac59088658b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请来一份「老样子」♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "331fd76c9c46d82a90841465aeeab1bf57c5e09e2211c7fd029222fb50136bcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:249bcc1a367bc66e49824500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想来一份最棒的训练～！\r\n耶嘿嘿，\r\n今天换训练员当店员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce2a3cb21899dc95770ec9b36942616ef0e1040267b90c0849e627c464dfb75f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aacad4a785b5c57ae656fb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我努力工作时客人都会为我加油！\r\n所以为了在竞赛时也能得到声援，\r\n我会努力表现的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d9b0624795323f859af78c306fa59a1479d8daf97e2089240dd0aae8a7c05f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3bac61f4c86e8332a837c2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是至今为止最开心的一次……！\r\n全都要感谢你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6658d83b562aec613d2d7beb5996cdc843d1374d02297da084a23f7d329fa54c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a68a0ca7d25789fd3248cd95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是最强的姐姐，\r\n也是你最棒的赛马娘……开玩笑的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdd90d14f0a2efd301df5a2881f5369f0c7dad52ed31e844e2fff6f9bb93f68d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00880b96b345f34d4ebf1099",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能将心意传达出去真是太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52140b0dfc9311c8c274d762f03fd401475d27bdc7c8c8667312ec9412c208e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e7711d3aadd81c7f0ad5278",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的表现应该符合你的要求吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "17f1dae642c4c89fb195677a76116e3516bc12629333a74ffab80d85143aa930",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:770709c4259f9bf24c65a916",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要变得更快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ceff9ad4f20e913da5fb439ba57e5f855b999612438ede08dea60885e19328e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83360fbe1d7f816985c31325",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还不会就此止步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d361e57fa812e355518ac2e5f312b7f4a790458610977159c6baa3486786756b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "95001"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
